    "language": "[0][1]This is incorrect. Uh, we don't need to... This, this statement is incorrect of, \"I've received the ball. Checking who should receive my pass.\" After I'm ready to make decisions, scanning for the best passing options now, I should just, you know, decide who should I pass to, not receive the ball, 'cause I already have the ball. (breathes deeply) (silence)[2] This is incorrect again. Coach[3] has pass available. He can pass to a left-winger[4] or a right-winger.[5] In this case, defender[6] actually blocks left striker[7] and right[8] striker, but there's a [9]path between [10]coach and right-winger and/or left-winger.[11] So, that's wrong.",
